s valid:true (BR-002)\n    - [ ] Comments-only content returns valid:true (BR-003)\n\n### Phase 2: CLI and Tests\n\n- [ ] **T2**: Create yaml-validate.ts CLI entry point with argument parsing, file/stdin input handling, and formatted output `[complexity:simple]`\n\n    **Reference**: [design.md#32-module-yaml-validatets](design.md#32-module-yaml-validatets)\n\n    **Effort**: 2 hours\n\n    **Acceptance Criteria**:\n\n    - [ ] Parses command-line arguments for file path and --help/-h flag\n    - [ ] Displays usage information when --help or -h flag provided\n    - [ ] Reads file content using Bun.file() when path argument provided\n    - [ ] Reads stdin content using Bun.stdin when no file argument\n    - [ ] Outputs \"Valid YAML\" message for valid content\n    - [ ] Outputs error details with line numbers for invalid content\n    - [ ] Exit code 0 for valid YAML\n    - [ ] Exit code 1 for invalid YAML syntax\n    - [ ] Exit code 2 for file not found\n    - [ ] Exit code 3 for read errors\n\n- [ ] **T3**: Create yaml-validator.test.ts with comprehensive unit tests for all validation functions `[complexity:medium]`\n\n    **Reference**: [design.md#7-testing-strategy](design.md#7-testing-strategy)\n\n    **Effort**: 5 hours\n\n    **Acceptance Criteria**:\n\n    - [ ] Test accepts valid key-value YAML\n    - [ ] Test accepts valid nested YAML\n    - [ ] Test accepts empty content\n    - [ ] Test accepts comments-only content\n    - [ ] Test accepts multi-document YAML\n    - [ ] Test rejects unclosed quotes\n    - [ ] Test rejects tab indentation\n    - [ ] Test rejects inconsistent indentation\n    - [ ] Test rejects unclosed brackets\n    - [ ] Test rejects invalid key-value syntax\n    - [ ] Test verifies correct line number in error\n    - [ ] Test verifies descriptive error messages\n    - [ ] All tests pass with bun test\n\n### Phase 3: Integration\n\n- [ ] **T4**: Add validate script to package.json for convenient command execution `[complexity:simple]`\n\n    **Reference**: [design.md#5-implementation-plan](design.md#5-implementation-plan)\n\n    **Effort**: 30 minutes\n\n    **Acceptance Criteria**:\n\n    - [ ] package.json contains \"validate\" script\n    - [ ] Script executes src/yaml-validate.ts\n    - [ ] Command works via `bun run validate <file>`\n\n- [ ] **T5**: Manual testing with real YAML files covering valid, invalid, and edge cases `[complexity:simple]`\n\n    **Reference**: [design.md#5-implementation-plan](design.md#5-implementation-plan)\n\n    **Effort**: 2 hours\n\n    **Acceptance Criteria**:\n\n    - [ ] Validate known-good YAML file returns success\n    - [ ] Validate known-bad YAML file returns error with line number\n    - [ ] Stdin piping works correctly\n    - [ ] Help flag displays usage information\n    - [ ] File not found returns appropriate error\n    - [ ] Performance acceptable for files under 1MB (<500ms)\n\n### User Docs\n\n- [ ] **TD1**: Update README.md - Scripts `[complexity:simple]`\n\n    **Reference**: [design.md#documentation-impact](design.md#documentation-impact)\n\n    **Type**: edit\n\n    **Target**: README.md\n\n    **Section**: Scripts\n\n    **KB Source**: -\n\n    **Effort**: 30 minutes\n\n    **Acceptance Criteria**:\n\n    - [ ] Scripts section documents the validate command\n    - [ ] Usage examples included for file and stdin modes\n\n- [ ] **TD2**: Update README.md - Structure `[complexity:simple]`\n\n    **Reference**: [design.md#documentation-impact](design.md#documentation-impact)\n\n    **Type**: edit\n\n    **Target**: README.md\n\n    **Section**: Structure\n\n    **KB Source**: -\n\n    **Effort**: 30 minutes\n\n    **Acceptance Criteria**:\n\n    - [ ] Structure section includes yaml-validate.ts\n    - [ ] Structure section includes yaml-validator.ts\n    - [ ] Structure section includes yaml-validator.test.ts\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Checklist\n\n- [ ] FR-001: File path validation - accepts file path as command-line argument and validates YAML content\n